  "bio": "Patrick Powell is renowned for his exceptional skill in creating traditional and illustrative tattoos. His work at Star Tattoo in Albuquerque, NM, showcases his meticulous attention to detail and artistic precision, leaving clients with stunning, long-lasting artistry on their skin. His dedication to the craft is evident in every piece he creates, ensuring that his clients' visions are brought to life with remarkable clarity and vividness.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Albuquerque, New Mexico, United States",
